# Privacy Policy for Canadian Citizenship Test

**Last Updated:** September 27, 2026  
**Effective Date:** September 27, 2026  

This Privacy Policy describes how the **Canadian Citizenship Test** mobile application ("the App", "we", "our", or "us"), provided by the application developer, collects, uses, and discloses information when you use our mobile application (Package Name: `com.wuweixin6.canadiancitizenshiptest`).

We are committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring compliance with applicable data protection laws, including Canada's Personal Information Protection and Electronic Documents Act (**PIPEDA**), the EU General Data Protection Regulation (**GDPR**), the California Consumer Privacy Act (**CCPA**), and Google Play Developer Policies.

---

## 1. Information We Collect

### A. Information Stored Locally on Your Device
The App is designed to function primarily offline and locally. We do not require you to create an account or provide personal identification information (such as your name, email address, or phone number) to use the App.

The following information is saved **locally on your device** using local storage (`AsyncStorage`):
- **Study Progress & Quiz Scores:** Question responses, test attempt history, simulated exam scores, and completion statistics.
- **App Preferences:** Selected province/territory, study mode settings, and notification preferences.
- **Usage Counts:** Daily question counts and exam attempts used to manage daily free-tier limits.

*This data remains on your device and is not transmitted to our private servers.*

### B. Information Collected Automatically by Third Parties
When you use the App, certain information may be collected automatically by third-party SDKs integrated into the App:

- **Google AdMob (Google LLC):**
  - **Device and Network Information:** Device model, operating system version, screen resolution, mobile carrier, language, and IP address.
  - **Advertising Identifiers:** Android Advertising ID (AAID) or Apple ID for Advertisers (IDFA).
  - **Ad Performance & Diagnostics:** Ad impressions, clicks, interaction times, and crash reports.
  - For more details on how Google processes data, please visit [Google's Privacy & Terms](https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites) and [Google AdMob Privacy Policy](https://support.google.com/admob/answer/6128543).

---

## 2. How We Use Your Information

We use the information collected for the following purposes:
- **Core Functionality:** To display relevant citizenship study questions, calculate test scores, track your learning progress, and simulate official citizenship tests.
- **Advertising:** To display banner, interstitial, and rewarded ads to support the free tier of the App.
- **App Improvement:** To monitor app performance, identify bugs, and optimize user experience.
- **Purchase Verification:** To verify premium subscription status via Google Play Billing / Apple App Store.

