## 4. In-App Purchases and Payments

The App offers optional Premium subscriptions and purchases (e.g., Monthly, Yearly, Lifetime access). All payments and subscriptions are processed directly through the **Google Play Store** (or Apple App Store). 

We do **not** collect, process, or store your credit card numbers, banking details, or billing addresses. All financial transactions are governed by the payment terms and privacy policies of the applicable app store.

---

## 5. Data Retention and Deletion

- **Local Data:** All quiz progress and preference data stored locally on your device can be permanently deleted at any time by clearing the App's data in your device settings or by uninstalling the App.
- **Third-Party Data:** Data collected by third-party advertising partners is retained in accordance with their respective retention policies. You can reset or delete your Advertising ID via your device settings:
  - **Android:** Settings > Google > Ads > Reset or Delete advertising ID.
  - **iOS:** Settings > Privacy & Security > Tracking > Toggle off "Allow Apps to Request to Track".

---

## 6. Children's Privacy (COPPA Compliance)

The App is intended for general audiences and individuals preparing for the Canadian citizenship test. We do not knowingly collect personal identifiable information from children under the age of 13 (or under 16 in certain jurisdictions). If you believe a child has provided us with personal information, please contact us so we can take immediate corrective action.

---

## 7. Your Privacy Rights

Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have specific rights regarding your data:

- **Canada (PIPEDA):** You have the right to access and correct personal data held about you and inquire about our information management practices.
- **European Economic Area (GDPR):** You have the right to access, rectify, port, or erase your data, and to restrict or object to certain processing.
- **California (CCPA/CPRA):** You have the right to know what personal information is collected, request deletion, and opt out of the "sale" or "sharing" of personal data for cross-context behavioral advertising.

