The **Canadian Citizenship Test** app is an independent educational tool developed to help users prepare for the official Canadian Citizenship Knowledge Test. **This application is NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or operated by Immigration, Refugees and Citizenship Canada (IRCC) or the Government of Canada.** All study materials are based on public study guide information ("Discover Canada").

